OL,3,GNEWSASpider-Man film vehicle sells for 
OL,4,A#49k at auction                        
OL,6,FAn original military vehicle used in   
OL,7,Fthe latest Spider-Man film has sold for
OL,8,F#48,875 at auction.                    
OL,10,FKnown on-screen as DD6, the machine    
OL,11,Fappeared in a tense chase sequence in  
OL,12,FSpider-Man: Brand New Day, featuring   
OL,13,Fthe web-slinging superhero played by   
OL,14,FTom Holland.                           
OL,16,FThe amphibious truck dates back to 1969
OL,17,Fand was bought from Nick Mead, of Tanks
OL,18,FA Lot in Brackley, Northamptonshire, by
OL,19,FMarvel during filming.                 
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
